- Calculation:
  - Failing to bound |S^{=n}| polynomially when aggregating multiple sets; must account for constant-length overhead correctly.
  - Choosing t(n) too small so that p(n) is not bounded by a polynomial in m = t(n); must pick r large enough so that p(n) ≤ t(n).
  - Forgetting that writing/querying a string of length t(n) costs O(t(n)) time; ensure t(n) is polynomial so the overall decider remains poly-time.
