- Calculation: Mixing signs in the characteristic polynomial recurrence; in characteristic 2, − becomes +. Forgetting to square polynomials correctly in char 2 (cross terms vanish).
- Completeness: Proving sufficiency (n works) but not necessity (no other n works), or failing to link p_n(λ)=λ^n to A^n=0 via Cayley–Hamilton.

