\[ E[M] = \sum_{t=1}^{\infty} \sum_{j=1}^{6} \binom{6}{j} (-1)^{j+1} 2^{-j(t-1)}. \]

步骤 3: For each fixed j in {1,...,6}, evaluate sum_{t=1}^{∞} 2^{−j(t−1)} as a geometric series to obtain 1/(1 − 2^{−j}) = 2^j/(2^j − 1), and reduce the double sum to E[M] = sum_{j=1}^{6} C(6,j)(−1)^{j+1} · 2^j/(2^j − 1); what closed-form finite sum results?
