\[
E[M] = \sum_{j=1}^{6} \binom{6}{j}(-1)^{j+1} \cdot \frac{2^j}{2^j - 1}
\]

**Answer:**  
\[ E[M] = \sum_{j=1}^{6} \binom{6}{j}(-1)^{j+1} \frac{2^j}{2^j - 1} \]

