- \( M = 2.016 \times 10^{-3} \, \text{kg/mol} \)

We substitute these into the formula:

\[
\langle v \rangle = \sqrt{\frac{8 \times 8.314462618 \times 300}{\pi \times 2.016 \times 10^{-3}}}
\]

Calculating the numerator:

\[
8 \times 8.314462618 \times 300 = 19954.3088
\]

Next, calculate the denominator:

\[
\pi \times 2.016 \times 10^{-3} = 0.006334431039
\]

Finally, calculate the square root of the division:

\[
\frac{19954.3088}{0.006334431039} \approx 3150447.611
\]

Then:

\[
\langle v \rangle = \sqrt{3150447.611} \approx 1770.2
\]

